# VCS
.git
.gitignore

# Python
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.venv
**/venv
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/dist
**/*.egg-info

# Build artifacts

# Editor/OS cruft
**/.DS_Store
**/.vscode
**/.idea

# Secrets/env — never send these to build context
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Docs, CI configs not needed in image
**/*.md
!**/README.md
.github

# Node (if any JS services live in the monorepo)
**/node_modules

**/.poetry
**/doc
**/tests/**
**/tests
**/data/database.db

.semgrepignore
poetry.lock
pyproject.toml
secrets/
